  "description": "ETEXIN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H96 Dy4 N18 O22 Zn2 2+,2(C2 H3 N1),2(Na1 1+),3.2(N1 O3 1-),0.8(N3 1-),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1A (Zn) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.533-3.779 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.19-108.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn2Dy4(L1)4(L2)2(OAc)2(N3)2][Na2(OH2)2(NO3)3.2(N3)0.8]·2MeCN (C108H106Dy4N25.6Na2O33.6Zn2). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
